{"job_id":"F-66e3a203f9a7afa42c91","family_id":"F-66e3a203f9a7afa42c91","title":"공군교육사령부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"491e34beb7200ddcb989df8fbac58af57a84b06e742bc68d49f524c4db015b45","source_hash":"6e2a8d796372ff21a09745ac57e47cd536b4e5b0f497a5d189a55113a153dec2","text":"空军教育司令部命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":170,"target_id":"37c902593afd6c5a455e8f6dd7c33e4c16eae628a00f198d728f5471a3c994db","source_hash":"39ea7ef1fdb71d4c86873da8f023fb2858880de013d033669103a1c7baf44635","text":"第 1 条（安装和任务）\n① 在空军内设立空军教育司令部（以下简称“教育司令部”）。\n② 教育司令部负责空军的飞行训练和军事专业训练，以及军官、士官、士兵（不包括军官学员）和预备役军官、士官、士兵和军官候选人的军事教育和训练。<2017年9月22日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":170,"end":203,"target_id":"6310e5c25d81bd940f153bd599e882c50acac4ad36527f7a631ceb2b9560f53e","source_hash":"df1bf6e49b760f088a584d7937376e832ef98f0d0631487487863dba3148bd1a","text":"第二条（地点）教育司令部的地点由空军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":203,"end":422,"target_id":"730f4d4c5bcf532d6606412e956f379d3e5160002ed3c395b9a7fd5347cebd53","source_hash":"205ed2e3338e69ee7976b40742d51d5d4177daf26bfd19ed0a93d964fb1ef2d4","text":"文章 3（指挥官）\n①应任命一名指挥官到教育司令部。\n② 司令官由总统根据国防部长的提议，并依据空军参谋长的建议，从空军将官中任命。<2017年9月5日修订>\n③ 司令官在空军参谋长的命令下，监督教育司令部的运作，并指挥和监督其附属单位（包括分配给教育司令部的单位）。\n④ 指挥官缺席时，参谋部军衔最高的长官代其履行职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":422,"end":551,"target_id":"0321965ce03e7a42c6d09081269d22fbecf977f2d2b32fdc2da8b104267ab783","source_hash":"75c9b54d53bd2023c9d0dcf333adb3c99cd90e5ca6695b6f83a6d3abe7be48f7","text":"第四条（部门和单位的设立）\n①在教育司令部内建立必要的部门和单位。\n② 第1款所述部门的组织和职责划分的必要事项，由空军参谋长决定；该单位的设立、任务和组织的必要事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":551,"end":670,"target_id":"638bd89de570b69a49bdff5a4706d4acd20707f988fb55592c9bb4da8e44ef14","source_hash":"c85e5ea1193ee06ea34471d5eef8e7ddbe929318006c48b0e63d7acacbd24d08","text":"第五条（维护军纪）司令官应当维护和执行空军参谋长指定区域内（以下简称“管辖区域”）空军部队的军纪。但是，由空军参谋长指定的空军部队除外。<2018年12月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":670,"end":857,"target_id":"113f6c472530fcd04c85f45d2ff12dbef57c9acf6f91842f88a870b557219fdf","source_hash":"9d5d4dc04ac9016c64e035017b55ca34e406fccd38a4739e243a91be8289a2cd","text":"第六条（对其他单位的临时指挥和监督）\n① 当因军事、疾病控制或灾害等紧急情况需要时，指挥官可以暂时指挥和监督其管辖范围内不属于其所属部队的空军部队。\n② 指挥官按照第1款规定行使临时指挥和监督权的，应当立即向空军参谋长报告情况，并同时通知有关部队的上级指挥官。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":857,"end":944,"target_id":"c7e487156a7143d455c2719a34b265041490a4058071ede7408b1e206d40969b","source_hash":"e508af71ed56023c5e4b83b0845ca677e36c8974221d76f7c55521a0cfdb7e2f","text":"第七条（教育司令部搬迁的事先批准）  司令员因灾害、疾病控制或军事需要而拟搬迁教育司令部时，必须获得空军参谋长的批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":944,"end":991,"target_id":"f7034bf8a19b30da25b0c8a5751c66bcbafa33c4eb79a48865158489fb0d54d2","source_hash":"1c1f5977e46219d56d4a6818c118b6024b9dae51484102fac4960114d70a7aa8","text":"第八条（人员配额）教育司令部应配备军人和文职人员，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":991,"end":1036,"target_id":"7c5d67d3f80072b5c2f8fdd00d27c1c5d00a9daca3df80f03ae162fdedc31c68","source_hash":"5fca42ff114548658252fa5eb981e00e6cacacec40d940e40efcdb46ae25a809","text":"补充条款 <第11053号，1983年2月14日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1036,"end":1069,"target_id":"e7c5eb9cc5cd5053e27d81958e274438f6bff0c76647110a16ae64ff87ec3445","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1069,"end":1106,"target_id":"5bfa6541215705803a84676c29fc88957e3a57dca59681cd3f75bb32a10ddb3f","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1106,"end":1120,"target_id":"e05762919b8c822ef32d18aa199d8bfeb788b2d44954928f9acf92fd0596cc6e","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第 2 条和第 3 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1120,"end":1231,"target_id":"10d76207a3cd12145f7bce305809df045cd132f119a01d92ee73daf4540ca984","source_hash":"43d805ae01fa467002a1eac83c1ad110b7d8689bddf1096a722afcd8bca5d62e","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至④ 省略\n\n  ⑤ 空军教育司令部法令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第3条第2款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  省略⑥至<90>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1231,"end":1264,"target_id":"3b82100e1e24d2b04f7b497215a9ad99c0747262ac14d7d18ffb93c34dfda4db","source_hash":"6f1ef95d117cf898d91efd246f3aed54d840623baf8fac8fefb3da80b6f0d194","text":"补充条款（兵役法实施令）<第28340号，2017年9月22日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1264,"end":1300,"target_id":"6e4609cbc8e0fc98efa382756e70880c9171239e154358939bde6c42369f4150","source_hash":"e34a5b9199baef979daf8f6723d71c1afe1479dfce30b34daaecf14f7116ba06","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2017年9月22日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1300,"end":1314,"target_id":"7ddb54ad23ad3be2ad9d2813b4da792992d512c91049362ebd4f62abc3d5ea6f","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1314,"end":1392,"target_id":"0fb6ac28040156c2adc699bfaf33e4573954809c310e623555d3a968c3d0b219","source_hash":"19adaa0ffda5e37622d2f27b94e5cf85dacaeab675946a58017877c530374595","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）空军教育司令部法令部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第一条第二款中的“军官候选人”应改为“军官候选人”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1392,"end":1424,"target_id":"c5dac0f0523008cda2d767b65ecfc641a7dd6053416e3a6d7cb320a09c708f00","source_hash":"de588adf60e2b9ab1eae09f068dfaec85007d837e2e47e4243decc39ddef51a7","text":"增补（作战指挥令）<编号 29321，2018 年 12 月 4 日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1424,"end":1459,"target_id":"12cf872f919d71eb3b3e5a091a0a6c3b4d7fb68f17cd5d8fda705da1f5762c5b","source_hash":"cd0498143f8ddb81f650d569a11c16e832dab70e6930facb820e7b6bf2e62145","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2019年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1459,"end":1467,"target_id":"73302bc0013a416b1ca72d3547ab6871873e4dfc4a6312bbebd64f8b37d441b0","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1467,"end":1519,"target_id":"761d34db4eb6e63bb829db08d91d9bf24b180217f7d2772a1affa0e4d15ffff7","source_hash":"b1d46334a08c9947d6e62430f80bc2a3c9015dfafa321c5c8e216d8003d5e068","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 空军教育司令部命令部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1519,"end":1569,"target_id":"22585f34c0671fa18c61fdd20d21d2362b33c923e10037b538c02002e37481d9","source_hash":"a680a87dd832b8b981de8faac58d546be0a9444e9b6c9af3d34259dec2252cee","text":"  第五条正文中的“Gunpunggi”应改为“Gungi（軍紀）”。\n\n  ③ 至 <16> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002265-205312-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1569,"end":1575,"target_id":"120bbe44372c11457adc0649e2ea6483bad4da23f52a531798c982ff994d47de","source_hash":"558c6d17486d0d6657212a87561377425c0a8eb8bdfabed29d681808202e17af","text":"第 4 条省略"}]}